WEBVTT

00:09:29.542 --> 00:09:31.518
It's called a relational account

00:09:31.542 --> 00:09:33.851
where you describe
how the request you're making

00:09:33.875 --> 00:09:36.167
is going to benefit
other people, not just you.

00:09:37.226 --> 00:09:39.226
But what if you're negotiating your salary

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:41.559
and it's not gonna help someone else?

00:09:41.583 --> 00:09:44.851
You can still highlight
how you'll use your negotiation skills

00:09:44.875 --> 00:09:46.875
to benefit your employer in the future.

00:09:47.875 --> 00:09:49.476
You might say something like,

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:51.018
"I'm going to represent myself

00:09:51.042 --> 00:09:53.143
with the same high
aspirations and integrity

00:09:53.167 --> 00:09:55.893
that I'll bring to the table
when representing you."

00:09:55.917 --> 00:09:57.268
(Upbeat music)

00:09:57.292 --> 00:09:59.518
GS: I'd always thought of negotiation

00:09:59.542 --> 00:10:03.018
as this zero-sum game,
like only one party could win